# "Regenerate target artifact": the target is an artifact, a noncreature one too - Mother of Runes, not an artifact, is refused (the
# refusal), and the Sol Ring is chosen (the positive control). Bot1's first Disenchant on the Sol Ring is replaced by the regeneration
# (CR 701.19a): it stays, tapped. The shield is used up, so a second Disenchant destroys it.

